        "b": 574.436101363195
      },
      "content": "Close external battery switch. This switch locates inside the battery cabinet or near battery rack. After the UPS system detects the battery, the red indicating light of battery (BAT) in panel will be off. Find the battery data in liquid crystal display field to check whether the battery voltage (500 V ~ 680 V) is correct or not."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0399",
      "reading_order": 485,
      "section": "Warning:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 568.2776629101563,
        "r": 541.3975999999996,
        "b": 527.606101363195
      },
      "content": "Inspect and confirm that there is no warning information in left bottom of LCD display screen. UPS is running under main power mode. Close the output switch and confirm display status of LED as shown in Table 4-3:"
    },
