      "section": "4.2.1 Start ECO Mode",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 130.22766291015637,
        "r": 541.60608,
        "b": 104.91610136319491
      },
      "content": "Click set icon ' ' in main interface and menu of 'advanced setting' (enter right password), and click to enter 'mode setting', select 'ECO mode' and then press 'YES'. Here, the 'ECO mode' is not effective, please make the UPS power down, and then power up, then the configured 'ECO mode' become effective. Operate according to normal  startup  steps,  the UPS  will  work in ECO mode. The display status of LED can be seen in Table 4-4:"
